<ns0:heading style="-uslm-lc:I71" class="centered"><ns0:inline class="small-caps">See Federal Rules of Criminal Procedure</ns0:inline></ns0:heading>
<ns0:p style="-uslm-lc:I21" class="indent0 fontsize7">Preparation, form; typewritten record, Rule 39(b).</ns0:p>
<ns0:p style="-uslm-lc:I21" class="indent0 fontsize7">Exceptions abolished, Rule 51.</ns0:p>
